@startuml
' Figure 12.7  Circuit breaker states
' Reading order: left to right from closed. Effects start only while
' closed; while open or half-open, refunds wait in the hold queue with
' their keys, and the probe is a read.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
hide empty description
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
[*] --> Closed
Closed : effects allowed
Open : effects held
state "Half-open" as HalfOpen
HalfOpen : read probes only
Closed --> Open : 40% of calls slow or failed\nin 20 s (at least six calls)
Open --> HalfOpen : after 15 s
HalfOpen --> Closed : two probes under 2 s
HalfOpen --> Open : a slow probe
@enduml
